# Anti-patterns (never)

```ts
// ❌ Single-letter / forbidden names
const m = useFlowMode();
const d = useActiveDiagram();

// ❌ Hardcoded UI strings
<button>Trazer para frente</button>

// ❌ disabled={true} constant
<button disabled={true}>

// ❌ Heavy logic in component body
const FlowPanel = () => {
  const steps = Object.values(flow.steps).filter(...).sort(...);
};

// ❌ I/O in Zustand slices
deleteDiagram: (id) => {
  fileSystemAdapter.deleteDiagram(id);
};

// ❌ Representable invalid combo state
interface State {
  isPlaying: boolean;
  isRecording: boolean;
}

// ❌ Feature internals import
import { buildEdge } from "@/features/canvas/edges/edgeBuilding";

// ❌ resolveCanvasSnapshot in selectors
const r = resolveCanvasSnapshot(diagram);
```

Use hooks/utils, `t()`, state-derived `disabled`, discriminated unions, `@/features/...` public `index.ts`, and `getCachedCanvasSnapshot`.
